{title: Sons of Dishon}
{subtitle: Genesis 36:26; 36:20–21; 1 Chronicles 1:41; Deuteronomy 2:12–22}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] |
