{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
In the land of Seir the mountain stood tall
[F]Lotan and [C]Shobal and Zibeon dwell [Dm]there
Anah and Dishon and Ezer and Dishan
[F]Chiefs of the [C]Horites ruling the do[Dm]main
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Hemdan and Eshban and [F]Ithran and [C]Cheran
[Dm]Sons of Dis[Bb]hon [C]walking in the [Dm]land
Original people before the [F]days were done [C]
[Dm]Roots in [Bb]the earth [C]where the sun is set [Dm]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The descendants of Esau came with their power
They [F]wiped them out and [C]took their [Dm]place
Just as Israel took the [F]promised [C]land
[Dm]Dispossessing [Bb]those who stood in the [Dm]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Hemdan and Eshban and [F]Ithran and [C]Cheran
[Dm]Sons of Dis[Bb]hon [C]walking in the [Dm]land
Original people before the [F]days were [C]done
[Dm]Roots in [Bb]the earth [C]where the sun is set [Dm]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Thir-ty-eight years the genera[F]tion passed
[Dm]The hand of [C]the Lord against the [Bb]camp
The fighting men perished from the [F]earth
Until the [Dm]last of the [C]old had [Bb]left
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Dm]Hemdan and Eshban and [F]Ithran and [C]Cheran
[Dm]Sons of Dis[Bb]hon in the [C]memory of [Dm]man
{end_of_verse}
